Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:01.91,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.25,0:00:03.16,Default,,0,0,0,,那么
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.42,0:00:04.96,Default,,0,0,0,,就赶紧开始吧
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.33,0:00:06.54,Default,,0,0,0,,来准备学园祭
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.88,0:00:08.29,Default,,0,0,0,,好的
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.55,0:00:10.84,Default,,0,0,0,,弦哥晚上回来
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.09,0:00:12.76,Default,,0,0,0,,赶在那之前搞定吧
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.92,0:00:14.93,Default,,0,0,0,,是啊
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.14,0:00:17.60,Default,,0,0,0,,在陌生的公寓里
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.68,0:00:19.43,Default,,0,0,0,,和辣妹两个人独处
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.64,0:00:21.47,Default,,0,0,0,,虽然应该不会发生什么
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.73,0:00:23.85,Default,,0,0,0,,等等 什么叫会发生什么
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.10,0:00:26.31,Default,,0,0,0,,美工刀在哪里来着
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.69,0:00:27.69,Default,,0,0,0,,找到了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.32,0:00:33.19,Default,,0,0,0,,各方面都很危险
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.40,0:00:34.49,Default,,0,0,0,,咦
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.61,0:00:36.95,Default,,0,0,0,,阿宅同学 难道说两个人独处
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.12,0:00:38.28,Default,,0,0,0,,让你心跳加速了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.49,0:00:40.54,Default,,0,0,0,,没有 才不会呢
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.66,0:00:42.75,Default,,0,0,0,,我可是相当平常心
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.71,0:00:44.75,Default,,0,0,0,,是吗
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.37,0:00:48.25,Default,,0,0,0,,我还挺开心的
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.25,0:00:52.51,Default,,0,0,0,,你看 在学校里的时候
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.71,0:00:55.55,Default,,0,0,0,,我们都没什么机会说话
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.38,0:00:59.64,Default,,0,0,0,,不过你看起来倒是挺开心的
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.80,0:01:00.85,Default,,0,0,0,,诶
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.01,0:01:02.27,Default,,0,0,0,,是有点开心
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.43,0:01:03.98,Default,,0,0,0,,大家一起做准备工作
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.06,0:01:07.40,Default,,0,0,0,,让我感觉自己总算融入了班级
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.60,0:01:10.44,Default,,0,0,0,,不过 其实我也有点难过
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.61,0:01:14.61,Default,,0,0,0,,能像这样一起做东西 我很开心
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.07,0:01:18.16,Default,,0,0,0,,这样啊 原来你也觉得开心啊
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.58,0:01:24.58,Default,,0,0,0,,来了啊 门没锁哦
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.75,0:01:26.29,Default,,0,0,0,,进来吧
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.54,0:01:32.25,Default,,0,0,0,,打扰了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.71,0:01:35.05,Default,,0,0,0,,天音大人驾到
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.26,0:01:37.80,Default,,0,0,0,,天音同学 你也来了啊
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.01,0:01:39.34,Default,,0,0,0,,不好意思 我来晚了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.55,0:01:40.97,Default,,0,0,0,,没关系啦
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.35,0:01:42.43,Default,,0,0,0,,你迷路了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.64,0:01:45.68,Default,,0,0,0,,-嗯 毕竟是第一次来你哥哥家\n-太好了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.93,0:01:48.85,Default,,0,0,0,,两个人独处的话 难免会心神不宁
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.48,0:01:50.73,Default,,0,0,0,,这不是布丁嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.90,0:01:53.23,Default,,0,0,0,,诶 是手绘杯垫啊
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.48,0:01:54.86,Default,,0,0,0,,做得真好
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.03,0:01:56.24,Default,,0,0,0,,对吧
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.36,0:01:59.24,Default,,0,0,0,,我特地请阿宅同学帮我把关了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.45,0:02:01.49,Default,,0,0,0,,咦
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.66,0:02:05.29,Default,,0,0,0,,这反而让情况更糟了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.08,0:03:35.59,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}（哪里有温柔对待阿宅的辣妹！？）
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.09,0:03:39.05,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}（第8节 居然要开过夜会 这样不好吧）
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.17,0:03:40.84,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}伊地知 帮忙拿下剪刀
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.30,0:03:42.63,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}好
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.22,0:03:48.43,Default,,0,0,0,,完成了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.64,0:03:50.06,Default,,0,0,0,,阿斯大人
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.18,0:03:54.06,Default,,0,0,0,,也就是银河支配者阿斯的头部
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.19,0:03:57.90,Default,,0,0,0,,完成度相当高嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.02,0:04:00.07,Default,,0,0,0,,阿宅同学 戴上试试
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.40,0:04:01.90,Default,,0,0,0,,好的
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.03,0:04:09.83,Default,,0,0,0,,掷出决定星辰命运的骰子吧
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.25,0:04:14.96,Default,,0,0,0,,阿斯大人的声音模仿得好像
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.04,0:04:17.84,Default,,0,0,0,,阿宅同学 兴致挺高的嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.50,0:04:21.01,Default,,0,0,0,,祝愿你的银河
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.01,0:04:23.30,Default,,0,0,0,,能有好运
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.93,0:04:27.60,Default,,0,0,0,,我也想试试
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.80,0:04:28.89,Default,,0,0,0,,可以啊
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.60,0:04:30.60,Default,,0,0,0,,请吧
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.81,0:04:31.81,Default,,0,0,0,,谢谢
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.10,0:04:32.89,Default,,0,0,0,,还有
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.94,0:04:35.40,Default,,0,0,0,,背心和裤子
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.60,0:04:36.44,Default,,0,0,0,,也都脱了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.73,0:04:39.23,Default,,0,0,0,,天音同学
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.73,0:04:40.65,Default,,0,0,0,,真色
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.73,0:04:42.40,Default,,0,0,0,,不是这样的
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.78,0:04:45.28,Default,,0,0,0,,不好好穿的话 对阿斯大人太失礼了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.41,0:04:47.82,Default,,0,0,0,,真是的
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.53,0:04:51.41,Default,,0,0,0,,我怎么可能会有下流的想法呢
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.33,0:04:53.37,Default,,0,0,0,,好
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.46,0:04:55.17,Default,,0,0,0,,调酒师服装搞定了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.58,0:04:57.58,Default,,0,0,0,,接下来只需要戴上这个
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.71,0:05:00.71,Default,,0,0,0,,没想到内部空间还挺狭小的
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.96,0:05:03.55,Default,,0,0,0,,这个会不会碰到嘴巴
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.55,0:05:06.55,Default,,0,0,0,,说起来
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.80,0:05:07.84,Default,,0,0,0,,这套衣服也是
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.05,0:05:10.47,Default,,0,0,0,,好像有阿宅同学的气味
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.89,0:05:11.81,Default,,0,0,0,,感觉
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.60,0:05:15.89,Default,,0,0,0,,阿宅同学靠得特别近
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.81,0:05:21.27,Default,,0,0,0,,她会说什么台词出场呢
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.57,0:05:24.86,Default,,0,0,0,,我觉得是第一季最后的台词
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.94,0:05:26.61,Default,,0,0,0,,那个
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.45,0:05:29.03,Default,,0,0,0,,还是算了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.28,0:05:30.83,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.99,0:05:33.41,Default,,0,0,0,,是不是对什么地方不满意
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.75,0:05:34.91,Default,,0,0,0,,不是的
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.12,0:05:38.46,Default,,0,0,0,,这个做得很精致 我怕会把它弄坏
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.84,0:05:42.50,Default,,0,0,0,,我先放这里了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.26,0:05:47.55,Default,,0,0,0,,还残留着一点气味
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.88,0:05:49.68,Default,,0,0,0,,难道说
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.01,0:05:51.39,Default,,0,0,0,,是太臭了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.47,0:05:52.39,Default,,0,0,0,,诶
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.47,0:05:53.77,Default,,0,0,0,,不是的
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.06,0:05:56.02,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯 完全没有这回事
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.35,0:05:57.60,Default,,0,0,0,,对不起
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.81,0:05:59.27,Default,,0,0,0,,都说不是啦
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.69,0:06:01.69,Default,,0,0,0,,来 继续做准备工作吧
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.90,0:06:05.03,Default,,0,0,0,,好的 我做的时候会离你远点的
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.36,0:06:08.45,Default,,0,0,0,,真是的 都说是误会了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.66,0:06:11.16,Default,,0,0,0,,阿宅与辣妹
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.45,0:06:15.33,Default,,0,0,0,,进度不错嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.50,0:06:18.16,Default,,0,0,0,,不过我还想再多做一点
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.46,0:06:19.50,Default,,0,0,0,,我也是
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.62,0:06:21.25,Default,,0,0,0,,就是啊
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.42,0:06:22.04,Default,,0,0,0,,可是
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.92,0:06:26.80,Default,,0,0,0,,都已经晚上了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.51,0:06:30.80,Default,,0,0,0,,明明好不容易才来劲
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.18,0:06:32.68,Default,,0,0,0,,这也没办法
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.05,0:06:34.68,Default,,0,0,0,,剩下的等去了学校再做吧
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.35,0:06:37.10,Default,,0,0,0,,不对 等等
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.48,0:06:40.60,Default,,0,0,0,,今天星期五 明天休息
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.77,0:06:43.15,Default,,0,0,0,,说到学园祭期间
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.69,0:06:45.57,Default,,0,0,0,,就该开过夜会吧
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.65,0:06:51.66,Default,,0,0,0,,哥哥家里有我过夜用的被褥
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.87,0:06:54.41,Default,,0,0,0,,天音可以和我一起睡客厅
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.78,0:06:57.95,Default,,0,0,0,,阿宅同学可以和弦哥一起睡
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.29,0:06:59.96,Default,,0,0,0,,这可不行
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.33,0:07:01.96,Default,,0,0,0,,我们还是学生
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.04,0:07:03.84,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么能和异性在外面过夜
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.29,0:07:05.88,Default,,0,0,0,,是啊 伊地知
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.50,0:07:08.21,Default,,0,0,0,,居然要开过夜会
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.80,0:07:10.59,Default,,0,0,0,,这样不好吧
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.88,0:07:11.97,Default,,0,0,0,,你看起来很有兴致啊
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.26,0:07:15.51,Default,,0,0,0,,你的表情很诚实呢 天音同学
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.68,0:07:18.98,Default,,0,0,0,,因为这样肯定很有趣啊
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.23,0:07:20.73,Default,,0,0,0,,阿宅同学 你也觉得可以吧
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.06,0:07:21.98,Default,,0,0,0,,诶
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.15,0:07:23.94,Default,,0,0,0,,可是
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.36,0:07:26.02,Default,,0,0,0,,准备工作也还没做完吧
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.15,0:07:29.65,Default,,0,0,0,,没关系的 我去问问看
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.94,0:07:32.49,Default,,0,0,0,,居然要和两个辣妹开过夜会
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.78,0:07:36.79,Default,,0,0,0,,就是说
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.29,0:07:38.95,Default,,0,0,0,,你们想在我家过夜是吧
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.25,0:07:41.41,Default,,0,0,0,,拜托了 弦哥
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.50,0:07:44.83,Default,,0,0,0,,正常来说肯定不行吧
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.21,0:07:47.13,Default,,0,0,0,,你们几个还是高中生吧
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.67,0:07:49.26,Default,,0,0,0,,也是
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.46,0:07:52.05,Default,,0,0,0,,话是这么说
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.09,0:07:55.30,Default,,0,0,0,,但今天破例允许一次
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.06,0:07:58.18,Default,,0,0,0,,但是
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.52,0:08:01.18,Default,,0,0,0,,必须要征得家长同意
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.98,0:08:04.10,Default,,0,0,0,,要是家长担心 我可以帮忙沟通
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.35,0:08:05.77,Default,,0,0,0,,好的
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.48,0:08:09.23,Default,,0,0,0,,喂 妈妈
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.61,0:08:11.19,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯 听我说
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.32,0:08:12.20,Default,,0,0,0,,今天
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.49,0:08:15.91,Default,,0,0,0,,我们想在伊地知哥哥家开过夜会
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.07,0:08:17.70,Default,,0,0,0,,-嗯\n-抱歉 我妈妈让你来接
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.95,0:08:21.71,Default,,0,0,0,,您好 我是伊地知琴子的哥哥
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.83,0:08:23.46,Default,,0,0,0,,是的
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.67,0:08:24.62,Default,,0,0,0,,好的
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.21,0:08:28.80,Default,,0,0,0,,谢谢你帮忙和我妈妈沟通
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.71,0:08:33.01,Default,,0,0,0,,你妈妈可是大吃一惊
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.22,0:08:38.10,Default,,0,0,0,,因为我从来没和朋友在外面过夜过
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.26,0:08:41.93,Default,,0,0,0,,年轻的时候多点这样的经历挺好的
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.68,0:08:45.06,Default,,0,0,0,,我上高中的时候也经常这样
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.48,0:08:46.60,Default,,0,0,0,,玩得开心点吧
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.90,0:08:48.23,Default,,0,0,0,,好的
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.48,0:08:49.36,Default,,0,0,0,,而且
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.77,0:08:52.57,Default,,0,0,0,,有我在的话 你也做不了奇怪的事吧
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.82,0:08:53.86,Default,,0,0,0,,阿宅同学
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.95,0:08:55.57,Default,,0,0,0,,我不会做的
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.41,0:08:57.70,Default,,0,0,0,,妈妈同意了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.95,0:08:59.41,Default,,0,0,0,,太好了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.70,0:09:02.08,Default,,0,0,0,,天音 我把我的衣服借给你穿
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.20,0:09:04.16,Default,,0,0,0,,阿宅同学就穿弦哥的衣服吧
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.25,0:09:05.37,Default,,0,0,0,,好的
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.46,0:09:07.00,Default,,0,0,0,,谢谢
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.08,0:09:07.96,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.34,0:09:09.21,Default,,0,0,0,,好耶
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.29,0:09:11.67,Default,,0,0,0,,今天晚上要开过夜会啦
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.88,0:09:13.01,Default,,0,0,0,,好
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.26,0:09:16.43,Default,,0,0,0,,然后
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.51,0:09:20.56,Default,,0,0,0,,翔和响好像都对纱优有好感
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.72,0:09:22.27,Default,,0,0,0,,那两个小鬼可真行啊
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.68,0:09:24.06,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}（男士内衣）
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.68,0:09:26.90,Default,,0,0,0,,便利店真是什么都有呢
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.10,0:09:30.11,Default,,0,0,0,,阿宅同学 你要哪款牙刷
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.15,0:09:34.32,Default,,0,0,0,,我的硬币啊
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.53,0:09:35.99,Default,,0,0,0,,伊地知玩得真好
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.24,0:09:42.04,Default,,0,0,0,,阿宅同学 你要吃吗
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.24,0:09:44.33,Default,,0,0,0,,谢谢
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.50,0:09:45.58,Default,,0,0,0,,那我就不客气了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.00,0:09:48.50,Default,,0,0,0,,不对 准备工作呢
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.83,0:09:52.34,Default,,0,0,0,,我正准备开始做呢
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.50,0:09:54.21,Default,,0,0,0,,这是小学生才会找的借口
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.38,0:09:57.97,Default,,0,0,0,,可我没什么干劲呢
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.76,0:10:02.22,Default,,0,0,0,,好 要不先冲个澡恢复精神吧
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.51,0:10:04.56,Default,,0,0,0,,阿宅同学 你先去吧
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.81,0:10:06.73,Default,,0,0,0,,诶 我先去吗
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.98,0:10:09.10,Default,,0,0,0,,还是你们俩先去吧
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.65,0:10:12.19,Default,,0,0,0,,他是说 让我们先去冲个澡再来吗
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.36,0:10:13.61,Default,,0,0,0,,感觉有点下流
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.69,0:10:15.99,Default,,0,0,0,,我可没有奇怪的想法
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.20,0:10:21.20,Default,,0,0,0,,谢谢你借我用浴室
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.45,0:10:22.74,Default,,0,0,0,,换下一个去吧
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.08,0:10:24.33,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯 谢谢
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.45,0:10:26.83,Default,,0,0,0,,天音
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.25,0:10:28.83,Default,,0,0,0,,我们一起洗吧
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.92,0:10:31.04,Default,,0,0,0,,倒是也行
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.38,0:10:32.84,Default,,0,0,0,,但两个人一起会不会很挤
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.00,0:10:35.92,Default,,0,0,0,,这里的浴室挺大的 不会的
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.51,0:10:38.43,Default,,0,0,0,,阿宅同学 你可不要偷看哦
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.63,0:10:39.68,Default,,0,0,0,,我才不会呢
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.59,0:10:43.76,Default,,0,0,0,,过夜会真开心啊
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.85,0:10:44.81,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.97,0:10:48.02,Default,,0,0,0,,学园祭结束以后也想这样做呢
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.27,0:10:50.69,Default,,0,0,0,,那下次来我家过夜吧
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.60,0:10:52.44,Default,,0,0,0,,真的吗
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.94,0:10:55.19,Default,,0,0,0,,到时候把水烧好 泡个澡吧
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.53,0:10:57.65,Default,,0,0,0,,那也太舒服啦
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.28,0:11:00.20,Default,,0,0,0,,专心做准备工作
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.91,0:11:06.62,Default,,0,0,0,,两个女生在浴室里独处
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.87,0:11:08.20,Default,,0,0,0,,会怎么样呢
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.17,0:11:12.00,Default,,0,0,0,,伊地知 你真可爱
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.33,0:11:14.59,Default,,0,0,0,,天音 你好帅
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.50,0:11:17.42,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么会这样
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.55,0:11:19.92,Default,,0,0,0,,我的心跳得比看闪萌的时候还快
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.05,0:11:21.13,Default,,0,0,0,,这样真的好吗
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.43,0:11:24.10,Default,,0,0,0,,我对闪萌的爱就只有这么点吗
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.18,0:11:25.14,Default,,0,0,0,,不对
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.22,0:11:26.39,Default,,0,0,0,,摒弃杂念
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.47,0:11:28.85,Default,,0,0,0,,桃色的烦恼啊 全都消失吧
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.06,0:11:30.06,Default,,0,0,0,,闪萌最棒
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.14,0:11:32.52,Default,,0,0,0,,-天音 快点\n-闪萌最棒
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.69,0:11:33.98,Default,,0,0,0,,还不行
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.90,0:11:39.28,Default,,0,0,0,,我快忍不住了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.65,0:11:40.78,Default,,0,0,0,,伊地知
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.65,0:11:43.41,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}（桃色）
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.12,0:11:45.20,Default,,0,0,0,,桃色
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.66,0:11:46.58,Default,,0,0,0,,现在
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.74,0:11:48.33,Default,,0,0,0,,我从一个阿宅
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.50,0:11:51.21,Default,,0,0,0,,沦落成了桃色脑袋
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.00,0:11:58.88,Default,,0,0,0,,不要认输
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.21,0:12:00.88,Default,,0,0,0,,阿斯大人
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.22,0:12:03.39,Default,,0,0,0,,我们都和你在一起
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.72,0:12:06.01,Default,,0,0,0,,我们永远都是一条心
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.18,0:12:08.64,Default,,0,0,0,,没错 你并不是一个人
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.93,0:12:11.10,Default,,0,0,0,,各位
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.27,0:12:14.56,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}（闪萌 桃色）
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.73,0:12:16.15,Default,,0,0,0,,咻咻
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.52,0:12:17.65,Default,,0,0,0,,赢了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.90,0:12:20.65,Default,,0,0,0,,我没有输给桃色
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.70,0:12:28.91,Default,,0,0,0,,谢谢各位
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.33,0:12:33.92,Default,,0,0,0,,天音 我快忍不住了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.21,0:12:35.50,Default,,0,0,0,,你还没冲够吗
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.58,0:12:36.58,Default,,0,0,0,,还没有
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.71,0:12:38.34,Default,,0,0,0,,好冷啊
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.59,0:12:39.92,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}（现实淋浴争夺战）
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.51,0:12:43.01,Default,,0,0,0,,我们冲好了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.26,0:12:44.63,Default,,0,0,0,,你在干活啊
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.80,0:12:45.84,Default,,0,0,0,,真了不起
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.18,0:12:48.76,Default,,0,0,0,,是的 我很专注
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.22,0:12:51.22,Default,,0,0,0,,感觉清爽多了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.85,0:12:55.52,Default,,0,0,0,,我们扎了同款丸子头
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.69,0:12:56.94,Default,,0,0,0,,可爱吧
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.23,0:12:59.23,Default,,0,0,0,,花了点时间
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.52,0:13:00.44,Default,,0,0,0,,对不起
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.48,0:13:02.53,Default,,0,0,0,,阿宅同学
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.82,0:13:04.99,Default,,0,0,0,,没什么
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.16,0:13:07.20,Default,,0,0,0,,这个样子很适合你们
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.45,0:13:10.58,Default,,0,0,0,,这款护手霜不油腻 推荐你用用
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.83,0:13:12.95,Default,,0,0,0,,不错啊 味道我也很喜欢
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.25,0:13:17.21,Default,,0,0,0,,感觉她们俩和平时不太一样
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.13,0:13:20.34,Default,,0,0,0,,阿宅同学 你看得也太入神了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.55,0:13:22.51,Default,,0,0,0,,不要一直盯着看啦
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.67,0:13:25.05,Default,,0,0,0,,素颜被看到感觉有点不好意思
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.34,0:13:27.09,Default,,0,0,0,,对不起
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.26,0:13:28.18,Default,,0,0,0,,不过
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.47,0:13:30.31,Default,,0,0,0,,你们素颜的样子也很可爱
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.81,0:13:35.89,Default,,0,0,0,,阿宅同学
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.48,0:13:39.06,Default,,0,0,0,,他是发自内心说的 所以才更坏心眼
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.27,0:13:40.15,Default,,0,0,0,,是啊
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.36,0:13:41.65,Default,,0,0,0,,诶 那个
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.78,0:13:43.57,Default,,0,0,0,,我说错话了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.20,0:13:48.28,Default,,0,0,0,,累死了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.70,0:13:51.33,Default,,0,0,0,,带来的全都做完了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.66,0:13:53.41,Default,,0,0,0,,已经快12点了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.87,0:13:54.95,Default,,0,0,0,,差不多该睡了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.21,0:13:56.25,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.41,0:13:58.83,Default,,0,0,0,,阿宅同学 你去跟弦哥一起睡吧
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.96,0:14:01.96,Default,,0,0,0,,原来是来真的吗
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.17,0:14:06.05,Default,,0,0,0,,你不想跟我一起睡吗
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.38,0:14:07.38,Default,,0,0,0,,阿宅同学
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.84,0:14:10.43,Default,,0,0,0,,没有的事
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.60,0:14:13.60,Default,,0,0,0,,我一直都很期待和弦一郎先生一起睡
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.85,0:14:15.56,Default,,0,0,0,,这么说也让人有点不爽
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.02,0:14:17.98,Default,,0,0,0,,那我就关灯了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.32,0:14:25.40,Default,,0,0,0,,天音同学
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.90,0:14:27.49,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么了 伊地知同学
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.95,0:14:28.95,Default,,0,0,0,,感觉
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.11,0:14:30.24,Default,,0,0,0,,睡不着啊
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.45,0:14:33.24,Default,,0,0,0,,我懂 有点像修学旅行的晚上
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.41,0:14:34.74,Default,,0,0,0,,是吧
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.41,0:14:36.75,Default,,0,0,0,,睡不着啊
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.00,0:14:38.71,Default,,0,0,0,,阿宅同学
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.46,0:14:41.71,Default,,0,0,0,,阿宅同学 你还醒着吗
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.21,0:14:43.55,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.63,0:14:45.76,Default,,0,0,0,,你喜欢的人是谁
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.88,0:14:47.63,Default,,0,0,0,,赶紧给我睡觉
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.05,0:14:50.59,Default,,0,0,0,,嘘 老师来了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.80,0:14:53.30,Default,,0,0,0,,谁是巡查的老师啊
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.51,0:14:54.39,Default,,0,0,0,,真是的
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.10,0:14:56.14,Default,,0,0,0,,你们几个
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.43,0:14:57.73,Default,,0,0,0,,难得开一次过夜会
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.81,0:14:58.85,Default,,0,0,0,,真的要睡觉吗
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.14,0:15:00.02,Default,,0,0,0,,诶
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.31,0:15:01.44,Default,,0,0,0,,我们那时候
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.60,0:15:04.36,Default,,0,0,0,,根本就没有人会睡觉
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.90,0:15:06.07,Default,,0,0,0,,都觉得那样很浪费时间
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.28,0:15:08.53,Default,,0,0,0,,只要睡觉就输了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.65,0:15:10.66,Default,,0,0,0,,就这么办
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.99,0:15:13.49,Default,,0,0,0,,先睡着的人要请其他人喝果汁
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.66,0:15:15.24,Default,,0,0,0,,这场比试算我一个
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.95,0:15:18.08,Default,,0,0,0,,那就把房间的灯关掉
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.20,0:15:20.04,Default,,0,0,0,,来看一部带字幕的难懂电影吧
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.37,0:15:22.54,Default,,0,0,0,,难度一下子提这么高啊
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.63,0:15:24.63,Default,,0,0,0,,摆明了故意让人犯困
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.88,0:15:26.63,Default,,0,0,0,,阿宅同学 你也要一起来对吧
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.05,0:15:28.76,Default,,0,0,0,,我倒是没问题
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.51,0:15:32.05,Default,,0,0,0,,不用顾虑我
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.26,0:15:35.39,Default,,0,0,0,,总比隔着墙听你们聊恋爱话题要好
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.89,0:15:38.89,Default,,0,0,0,,不过现在已经半夜了 动静不要太大
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.06,0:15:40.19,Default,,0,0,0,,好的
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.89,0:15:42.65,Default,,0,0,0,,那要看哪部电影呢
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.85,0:15:44.69,Default,,0,0,0,,阿宅同学 该你出场了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.23,0:15:46.65,Default,,0,0,0,,诶 我来定吗
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.03,0:15:48.53,Default,,0,0,0,,那就开始啦
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.78,0:15:50.53,Default,,0,0,0,,只要睡觉就输了的观影会
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.61,0:15:51.78,Default,,0,0,0,,真是青春啊
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.83,0:15:58.91,Default,,0,0,0,,电影开场的时候会很兴奋呢
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.08,0:16:00.16,Default,,0,0,0,,我懂
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.25,0:16:01.50,Default,,0,0,0,,我想吃爆米花
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.58,0:16:03.00,Default,,0,0,0,,这个位子归我了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.96,0:16:06.88,Default,,0,0,0,,故意假装轻松 其实肯定会先睡着
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.17,0:16:08.67,Default,,0,0,0,,我才不会睡呢
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.55,0:16:10.88,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}各位要不要来点喝的
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.05,0:16:12.01,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}不用了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.22,0:16:14.14,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}-话说 阿宅同学\n-你和那位夫人后来怎么样了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.34,0:16:15.18,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}她有没有说什么
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.60,0:16:16.93,Default,,0,0,0,,你喜欢的人是谁
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.06,0:16:19.14,Default,,0,0,0,,还要继续聊这个话题啊
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.39,0:16:20.68,Default,,0,0,0,,我也想知道
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.81,0:16:22.44,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么天音同学也来凑热闹
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.81,0:16:23.90,Default,,0,0,0,,有什么关系嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.98,0:16:26.06,Default,,0,0,0,,我们会给你保守秘密的
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.27,0:16:28.44,Default,,0,0,0,,那我喜欢闪萌里的…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.65,0:16:30.74,Default,,0,0,0,,只能回答我们班的人
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.57,0:16:33.32,Default,,0,0,0,,我之前也说过
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.41,0:16:35.45,Default,,0,0,0,,我还没有喜欢的人
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.82,0:16:38.58,Default,,0,0,0,,那假设要交往的话 你会选谁
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.83,0:16:41.62,Default,,0,0,0,,就当是假设 说说看吧
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.00,0:16:44.08,Default,,0,0,0,,-既然这样\n-我不喜欢你的态度
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.50,0:16:47.84,Default,,0,0,0,,我在班上能正常说上话的
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.96,0:16:49.55,Default,,0,0,0,,就只有两个人
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.88,0:16:51.46,Default,,0,0,0,,所以我选伊地知同学
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.72,0:16:54.13,Default,,0,0,0,,还有天音同学
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.01,0:16:56.30,Default,,0,0,0,,耶
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.55,0:16:57.97,Default,,0,0,0,,从我嘴里套出话来了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.35,0:16:59.85,Default,,0,0,0,,那我也要问问她们
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.06,0:17:02.10,Default,,0,0,0,,那你们俩会选谁呢
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.18,0:17:04.23,Default,,0,0,0,,只能回答阿宅
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.52,0:17:06.98,Default,,0,0,0,,开玩笑的
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.19,0:17:09.98,Default,,0,0,0,,-这个嘛\n-这个啊
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.36,0:17:12.28,Default,,0,0,0,,阿宅同学 当然是你了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.11,0:17:17.12,Default,,0,0,0,,还是来看电影吧
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.20,0:17:19.12,Default,,0,0,0,,就算是玩笑话 也挺不好意思的
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.20,0:17:21.12,Default,,0,0,0,,是啊
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.79,0:17:25.67,Default,,0,0,0,,已经2点多了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.87,0:17:28.29,Default,,0,0,0,,天音同学 你看起来还很精神呢
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.46,0:17:30.71,Default,,0,0,0,,我本来就是夜猫子
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.96,0:17:33.51,Default,,0,0,0,,甚至熬到过闪萌开播
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.84,0:17:35.51,Default,,0,0,0,,一直熬到早上10点吗
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.68,0:17:38.35,Default,,0,0,0,,同为阿宅 我可不能输
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.64,0:17:41.18,Default,,0,0,0,,不要随随便便把我当阿宅
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.51,0:17:43.18,Default,,0,0,0,,我才不一样呢
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.81,0:17:45.02,Default,,0,0,0,,话说
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.90,0:17:48.56,Default,,0,0,0,,伊地知 你快睡吧
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.02,0:17:50.48,Default,,0,0,0,,我才不睡呢
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.65,0:17:52.57,Default,,0,0,0,,我一点都不困
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.65,0:17:55.15,Default,,0,0,0,,毕竟刚才一直在闹腾
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.28,0:17:57.41,Default,,0,0,0,,没关系 不用勉强的
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.91,0:18:01.20,Default,,0,0,0,,你们俩怎么一脸赢定了的表情
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.37,0:18:02.91,Default,,0,0,0,,我是绝对不会睡的
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.12,0:18:05.79,Default,,0,0,0,,我要等你们睡着了和你们拍照留念
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.50,0:18:08.79,Default,,0,0,0,,你觉得是我捅了约翰
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.25,0:18:10.46,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}对事不对人
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.71,0:18:11.63,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}这就是我的工作
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.00,0:18:12.96,Default,,0,0,0,,他死了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.42,0:18:15.01,Default,,0,0,0,,是的 他背后被捅了一刀
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.60,0:18:22.68,Default,,0,0,0,,警察 你们全都一个样
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.52,0:18:25.18,Default,,0,0,0,,这部电影真好看
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.43,0:18:27.31,Default,,0,0,0,,拍得很好呢
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.98,0:18:32.02,Default,,0,0,0,,伊地知出局了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.32,0:18:34.32,Default,,0,0,0,,接下来就是单挑了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.53,0:18:36.57,Default,,0,0,0,,天音同学 我是不会输的
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.86,0:18:38.74,Default,,0,0,0,,你赢得了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.16,0:18:41.83,Default,,0,0,0,,你连称号都没有 只是个阿宅同学
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.12,0:18:44.08,Default,,0,0,0,,赢得了铁面具大人吗
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.45,0:18:47.91,Default,,0,0,0,,那就开始看第二部了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.04,0:18:50.21,Default,,0,0,0,,正合我意
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.54,0:18:51.50,Default,,0,0,0,,我们去吃点东西吧
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.84,0:18:52.71,Default,,0,0,0,,好
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.79,0:18:53.96,Default,,0,0,0,,天音同学
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.21,0:18:57.01,Default,,0,0,0,,你为什么要隐瞒自己是阿宅的事呢
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.26,0:18:58.88,Default,,0,0,0,,都说了 我不是
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.89,0:19:05.97,Default,,0,0,0,,因为 我和其他人都聊不来
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.23,0:19:11.10,Default,,0,0,0,,我是初二的时候迷上闪萌的
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.81,0:19:15.65,Default,,0,0,0,,身边的朋友基本都在聊帅气的男生
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.82,0:19:18.24,Default,,0,0,0,,或者明星的话题
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.95,0:19:23.32,Default,,0,0,0,,我很害怕
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.83,0:19:25.45,Default,,0,0,0,,担心只有自己不合群
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.41,0:19:28.66,Default,,0,0,0,,我也试着和喜欢动画的人聊过
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.75,0:19:30.08,Default,,0,0,0,,但是没人看过这部作品
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.75,0:19:33.71,Default,,0,0,0,,毕竟是一部女童向动画
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.17,0:19:35.00,Default,,0,0,0,,而且
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.09,0:19:38.55,Default,,0,0,0,,风格还特别黑暗小众
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.92,0:19:43.26,Default,,0,0,0,,不过我就是喜欢这一点
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.89,0:19:46.56,Default,,0,0,0,,像这样隐藏阿宅的喜好之后
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.72,0:19:49.39,Default,,0,0,0,,很多真心话也慢慢说不出口了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.85,0:19:52.52,Default,,0,0,0,,该怎么说呢 就是过得畏手畏脚的
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.73,0:19:53.81,Default,,0,0,0,,应该可以这样说吧
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.36,0:19:55.65,Default,,0,0,0,,比起自己的心情
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.15,0:19:58.65,Default,,0,0,0,,我更在意周围的眼光
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.11,0:20:01.99,Default,,0,0,0,,慢慢变得不像自己了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.36,0:20:05.66,Default,,0,0,0,,结果感到开心的时间也越来越少
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.04,0:20:08.79,Default,,0,0,0,,原来就连天音同学这样的人
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.41,0:20:11.37,Default,,0,0,0,,也会有这种烦恼啊
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.75,0:20:16.50,Default,,0,0,0,,所以我现在特别开心
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.17,0:20:22.68,Default,,0,0,0,,伊地知让我自然而然地觉得
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.80,0:20:24.34,Default,,0,0,0,,无论我怎么样 她都可以接受
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.68,0:20:26.60,Default,,0,0,0,,所以和她在一起感觉很舒服
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.01,0:20:30.68,Default,,0,0,0,,而你是唯一一个同样喜欢闪萌的人
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.89,0:20:33.85,Default,,0,0,0,,我从没想过能和别人聊得这么开心
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.94,0:20:35.98,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么会呢
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.19,0:20:38.36,Default,,0,0,0,,我也是一样的
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.53,0:20:42.15,Default,,0,0,0,,像我这种人根本就没朋友
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.40,0:20:45.28,Default,,0,0,0,,原本就连跟他人交流都不擅长
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.45,0:20:48.28,Default,,0,0,0,,但是跟你们俩聊天
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.70,0:20:49.70,Default,,0,0,0,,让我觉得很喜欢
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.00,0:20:52.00,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.33,0:20:54.50,Default,,0,0,0,,也许这么说有点恶心
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.92,0:20:57.38,Default,,0,0,0,,但最近我偶尔会想
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.59,0:20:59.96,Default,,0,0,0,,现在实在是太幸福了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.76,0:21:01.92,Default,,0,0,0,,真希望
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.84,0:21:05.43,Default,,0,0,0,,时间能一直停留在这一刻
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.89,0:21:08.01,Default,,0,0,0,,我也是
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.68,0:21:10.22,Default,,0,0,0,,来拍张照吧
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.18,0:21:14.94,Default,,0,0,0,,为了不忘记这一刻
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.41,0:22:57.87,Default,,0,0,0,,各位学生 早上好
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.96,0:23:00.75,Default,,0,0,0,,所以是谁坚持到了最后
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.63,0:23:06.21,Default,,0,0,0,,全都出局了啊
